# settings: status_mode=1
# settings: shapes=1
# settings: shape_quads=0
# settings: shape_round=0
# settings: shape_hold_ms=400
# settings: shape_corner=40
# Corner roundness (2.0.0-rc.12) at 40%: a snapped rectangle, triangle and parallelogram have
# arcs for corners, in their stored points (the sharpest turn from one point to the next is a
# few degrees, not 90), drawn live exactly as a fresh drawing of the page draws them. Back at 0
# (Sharp, a tap at the slider's left end) the corners are sharp again. A circle is no polygon.
wait 300
tap 200 400
wait 300
pen leave
wait 1100
expect editor.strokes is 0
